  #line-at(72.024pt, 312.53pt, "designed between the heater top-surface and the space between the magnetic poles, such that ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 333.29pt, "the superheated substrate was effortlessly slid from the heater within the magnetic field ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 353.93pt, "region rapidly during the experiment. A micro-syringe with a volumetric accuracy of ± 0.1 μl, ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 374.69pt, "fit with a flat-tipped 22-gauge needle, was attached to a height-adjustable droplet dispensing ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 395.33pt, "mechanism (DDM) to dispense droplets from different heights. A high-speed camera ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 415.97pt, "(Photron, UK) with 105 mm macro lens (Sigma) was used to capture the droplet interaction ")
